{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","海葬之潮"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人受到控制效果后会进入“溺水”，“溺水”的敌人受到的伤害提升；涅尔瓦释放大招后提升攻击力和攻击速度，普通攻击可以在“溺水”的敌人间弹射。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每名敌人累计受到6秒的控制状态时，对该名敌人施加“溺水”：造成350% + 35% ATK伤害，涅尔瓦对处于“溺水”的敌人造成的伤害增加30%，直到战斗结束。对伤害类型为魔法的敌人，施加“溺水”所需的控制时长缩短至4秒。\n主动使用时，涅尔瓦使用潮汐之力增强自身12秒。潮汐之力持续时间内涅尔瓦提升22%攻击力和60 + 8点攻击速度，同时使自身的普通攻击额外携带“潮涌”效果：命中时会向“溺水”的敌人依次弹射“潮涌”造成额外220% + 30% ATK伤害，每个角色最多被弹射1次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":161,"end":165,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":220,"end":226,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":216,"end":230,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至24%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至26%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至28%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","潮汐之力持续时间内的攻击力提升至30%，“潮涌”造成的额外伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","溯魂脊刺"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","每隔若干次普攻得到强化：命中时击退敌人，造成额外伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每进行3次普通攻击后，涅尔瓦的下一次普通攻击会得到增强：在命中敌人后会击退敌人{KnockBack}格，造成270% + 30% ATK伤害并使其眩晕持续2秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","飞裂激流"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内敌人造成伤害，短暂延迟后击飞范围内敌人并再次造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","涅尔瓦向敌人最密集的地图格丢出长矛，命中时对周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成140% + 20% ATK伤害，并在2秒后升起激流，击飞相同范围内的所有敌人并造成210% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":50,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","长矛命中时造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK，激流升起时对敌人造成的伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","长矛命中时造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK，激流升起时对敌人造成的伤害提升至270% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","长矛命中时造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK，激流升起时对敌人造成的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升33点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","冥海之拥"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时立刻为最靠后的敌人施加“溺水”。“溺水”的敌人攻击力与急速降低，处于控制状态时持续受到伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，选择布阵格最靠后的敌人立刻施加“溺水”。处于“溺水”的敌人的攻击力降低20%，急速降低40点，并且使其每累计处于控制状态0.5秒就受到50% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":73,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“溺水”的敌人处于控制状态时每0.5秒受到的伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","施加“溺水”时，涅尔瓦立刻获得600% ATK的永久潮涌护盾，潮涌护盾在受到魔法伤害时的护盾损耗量降低60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“溺水”的敌人处于控制状态时每0.5秒受到的伤害提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","所有非召唤物敌人处于“溺水”状态后潮汐之力永久持续，同时提升自身穿透。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当场上的所有非召唤物敌人均处于“溺水”，或累计已有4名非召唤物敌人曾被施加“溺水”时，涅尔瓦立刻获得1000能量并使潮汐之力的持续时间改为永久。当涅尔瓦处于永久潮汐之力状态且能量大于800时，自身额外获得30点穿透。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","归脊之矛"]]}